<title>USA: TABLE - Bethlehem Steel Corp Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bethlehem Steel Corp Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BETHLEHEM, Pa. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.33		    $0.14</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.19		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net			160,000		   26,600</p>
<p> Revs		   1,206,900		1,236,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 112,300		  111,100</p>
<p>		     First Half</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.58		    $0.05</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.47		    $0.05</p>
<p> Net			198,400		   26,700</p>
<p> Revs		   2,399,400		1,355,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 112,100		  111,000</p>
<p>(All Data Omits 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 net includes after-tax gain $113 million, or $1.01/shr on sale of Iron Ore Co of Canada equity.</p>
<p>Excluding gain, 1997 Q2 was $0.32/shr. First Call consensus was $0.23/shr.</p>
<p>Per share after preferred dividends of $10.4 million vs $10.5 million in quarter and $20.8 million vs $21.0 million in half.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
